asset: tests/fixtures/tiles_hevc.mp4
title: HEVC (mp4) 128x72
author: Amrit Rosell — procedural pattern dxvkit_plus_core::testpattern::tiles (carried over from Loombda-rs loombda_media::testpattern)
source: Minted in Loombda-rs (crates/loombda-media/examples/mint_fixtures.rs; reproducible here with scripts/mint-fixtures.sh) (128x72, 24 frames, 30 fps); encoded with glenc-cli 1.0.0 -c hevc (GlEnc, Amrit's encoder; AVFoundation / VideoToolbox for the native codecs)
license: CC0-1.0
added: 2026-10-10
sha256: a3eb4ae5f87b5f598167223d42f42f70424f23535b63988dd180ea9426d24374
notes: Our own footage, no third-party content. Tiles are RGB565-exact and alpha is flat per 8x8 tile so BC encoders can reproduce the source; the top tile row encodes the frame index. Copied unchanged (cp -p) from Loombda-rs tests/fixtures/media @ d2c0c43.
